classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ working UML draft (Phase 1). Update in Phase 6 to match the final code.

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_minutes
        +str day_start
        +List~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_pet(name: str) Pet
        +get_all_tasks() List~Task~
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +List~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +get_pending_tasks() List~Task~
    }

    class Task {
        +str title
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +bool completed
        +mark_complete() None
        +priority_score() int
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +List~tuple~ plan
        +sort_tasks(tasks: List~Task~) List~Task~
        +build_daily_plan() List~tuple~
        +explain_plan() str
    }

    Owner "1" o-- "*" Pet : has
    Pet "1" *-- "*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : plans for